{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0586B0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你居然能从Strangelove的<R=研究设施,LAB>逃出来。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=研究设施,LAB>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":61,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"设施里的警备没那么严。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"当然，房间门是从外面锁着的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不过洗澡的时候，她会摘掉我的眼罩。因为还要帮我洗头……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"作为俘虏，待遇还真好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"是啊。手铐倒是没给我解开，不过她会替我洗身体。洗得还挺仔细。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"为什么逃？她不是说一个月后会放你回去吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"如果逃跑失败，你的处境可能会更危险。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我本来要在学会上发表哥斯达黎加鸟类分布的研究。期限快到了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"所以我假装去厕所，打算趁机逃跑。我找到一张ID卡，又到处找器材和录音带……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":110,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"可还是被士兵看见了。光是能逃出来都算奇迹，根本没余裕再找录音带。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"学会只能放弃了。能保住这副身体就已经很幸运。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"你转换心情还真快。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"你不会吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"……不知道。我也没觉得自己一直执着于过去……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"执着也没用。能获救就很好了。我在那里也好几次觉得自己有生命危险。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"是吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"……她似乎对女人有兴趣。而且好像特别喜欢我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"这可……唔。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"而且，<R=这里,MOTHER BASE>是个好地方。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=这里,MOTHER BASE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}